+      ["An opinionated house", "That evening, they found the chair facing the cold fireplace. They turned it towards the window. By morning, it faced the fireplace again.", "\u201CVery opinionated subsidence,\u201D Natalie said. They checked the chimney. Behind a loose brick lay a tin box containing a recipe, two buttons and a photograph of someone laughing in that very chair.", "They put the photograph on the mantelpiece and lit a fire. The chair stayed where they left it."],
